{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play tabletop basketball with realistic physics in relaxing environments. Compete in customizable leagues and cups, edit teams, win and complete your trophy room. Earn points to unlock courts, tracks, and balls. Play with friends locally or online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907560/extras/763b18f92a914421e72a54fc11796891.poster.avif?t=1760086065\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907560/extras/763b18f92a914421e72a54fc11796891.webm?t=1760086065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907560/extras/763b18f92a914421e72a54fc11796891.mp4?t=1760086065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with just two buttons. Capture the ball when it comes near your area and hold the shoot button to choose power and score before the possession time runs out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Profiles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and manage multiple profiles so each player can save their progress, trophies, unlockables, and custom teams without mixing them with others. Protect them with a password if you wish; competitions created in a profile can only be played from that profile, ensuring a personal and independent experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907560/extras/9c1c7f040d8b2a6b6f0b6e572910ba09.avif?t=1760086065\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Editing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize any of the 20 available teams by changing their name and logo. Create unique combinations and play leagues and cups with your own designs, adding your personal touch to each championship.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Championships and Trophies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in customizable league and cup tournaments with up to 20 teams. Each tournament has a unique trophy based on the number of participants, which you can earn by winning the final playoff. Visit your trophy room to admire your achievements.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907560/extras/ff47ac9b8e85950f399bb7de088eb4f7.poster.avif?t=1760086065\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907560/extras/ff47ac9b8e85950f399bb7de088eb4f7.webm?t=1760086065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockables</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn points to unlock courts, tracks, and balls. Get bonuses for victories and championships. Higher difficulty levels give better bonuses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >36 Balls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >32 Courts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 Locations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each profile has its unlockables in a unique order\u2014no two are the same!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play 1v1 matches online by creating or joining a host. Locally, up to 20 players can compete in leagues or cups, each with their own profile and team.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3907560?t=1760086065","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907560/400cb1050bd833d9ee002278301026e36473cf7e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760086065","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907560/f43440059ab8b5b2958dd6c756398c0ce1aa6ece/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760086065","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907560/f43440059ab8b5b2958dd6c756398c0ce1aa6ece/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760086065","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play tabletop basketball with realistic physics in relaxing environments. Compete in customizable leagues and cups, edit teams, win and complete your trophy room. Earn points to unlock courts, tracks, and balls. Play with friends locally or online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati