g>Championships and Trophies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in customizable league and cup tournaments with up to 20 teams. Each tournament has a unique trophy based on the number of participants, which you can earn by winning the final playoff. Visit your trophy room to admire your achievements.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907560/extras/ff47ac9b8e85950f399bb7de088eb4f7.poster.avif?t=1760086065\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907560/extras/ff47ac9b8e85950f399bb7de088eb4f7.webm?t=1760086065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockables</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn points to unlock courts, tracks, and balls. Get bonuses for victories and championships. Higher difficulty levels give better bonuses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >36 Balls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >32 Courts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 Locations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each profile has its unlockables in a unique order\u2014no two are the same!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play 1v1 matches online by creating or joining a host. Locally, up to 20 players can compete in leagues or cups, each with their own profile and team.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Ledicia Interactiva"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s